Description: DayZ dedicated server operator
 dzo manages DayZ dedicated server instances on top of rootless podman
 quadlets: it installs and updates server builds and workshop mods,
 renders per-instance missions and configuration, and provides a
 built-in BattlEye RCon client, container health checks and
 btrfs-snapshot backups.
 .
 This package creates the "dayz" system user and its data directories,
 but never starts any game server on its own; use "dzo setup" after
 installation to configure and bring up instances.
